# 2. BUSINESS AND BRAND CONTEXT

## 2.1 Master brand

TOURMS is the master brand.

Primary brand expression:

SAME SOUND, DIFFERENT FREQUENCY.

The philosophy communicates two ideas:

SAME SOUND:
- A consistent identity.
- Shared standards.
- A common ambition.
- A recognisable way of building businesses and products.

DIFFERENT FREQUENCY:
- Different industries.
- Different markets.
- Different products.
- Different technologies.
- Different ways of solving problems.

Supporting brand expressions:

- One sound. Many expressions.
- One company. Many possibilities.
- Strength in structure. Freedom to grow.

Internal creative philosophy:

THE BUILDER + THE SYSTEM.

These expressions should not compete as multiple primary slogans.

The master brand should remain recognisable without forcing every business unit to look identical.

## 2.2 Current product

The product being designed is:

TOURMS AGRO-SOLUTIONS

Public positioning:

AGRICULTURE, CONNECTED BETTER.

Core description:

Work, opportunity and knowledge for the people and businesses shaping agriculture.

TOURMS AGRO-SOLUTIONS is an agricultural platform connecting people, employers, organisations, opportunities and useful knowledge.

It should serve agricultural professionals, students, graduates, workers, employers, agribusinesses, institutions and organisations.

The product is Nigeria-first, with an architecture capable of supporting expansion across Africa.

